$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Ugi product 12a. According to General Procedure I, reaction between
alkylated DHP-2-one 11 (100 mg, 0.22 mmol), paraformaldehyde (10 mg, 0.33
mmol), benzylamine (36 μl, 0.33 mmol) and propionic acid (18 μl, 0.24
mmol) in MeOH (500 μl) afforded after 22 h 12a (143 mg, 0.22 mmol, 100%)
as a white foam. Column chromatography was performed with c-hexane/EtOAc
7:3→ 6:4 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO, 403K): δ (ppm) 7.80 (bs, 1H), 7.67-7.63
(m, 2H), 7.44-7.40 (m, 2H), 7.38-7.20 (m, 12H), 7.07-7.02 (m, 2H),
7.01-6.97 (m, 2H), 5.68 (d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 5.21 (d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 4.28
(d, JAB = 15.7 Hz, 1H), 4.14 (d, JAB = 15.7 Hz, 1H), 4.04 (d, JAB = 17.1
Hz, 1H), 3.91 (d, JAB = 17.1 Hz, 1H), 3.65 (s, 2H), 2.18-1.97 (m, 2H),
1.37 (s, 9 H), 0.95 (t, J= 7.4 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (101 MHz, DMSO, 403K): δ
(ppm) 173.0 (C), 168.9 (C), 166.1 (C), 165.8 (C), 138.9 (C), 138.6 (C),
137.1 (C), 136.6 (C), 133.9 (C), 128.2 (2 CH), 127.9 (CH), 127.7 (2 CH),
127.7 (2 CH), 127.6 (2 CH), 126.9 (CH), 126.8 (4 CH), 126.6 (CH), 126.5
(4 CH), 126.3 (CH), 111.8 (CH), 80.9 (C), 63.1 (C), 49.4 (CH2), 49.2
(CH2), 46.6 (CH2), 41.9 (CH), 27.0 (3 CH3), 24.6 (CH2), 8.3 (CH3); IR
(neat): 3362 (w), 2978 (w), 1742 (m), 1663 (s), 1495 (m), 1366 (m), 1225
(m), 1152 (s), 762 (m), 696 (s), 590 (m), 519 (m). HRMS (EI, 70 eV):
calculated for C41H43N3O5 (M+) 657.3197, found 657.3211.
