$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Passerini product 16. According to General Procedure II, reaction between
alkylated DHP-2-one 11 (100 mg, 0.22 mmol), paraformaldehyde (10 mg, 0.33
mmol) and propionic acid (18 μl, 0.24 mmol) afforded after 48 h. 16 (122
mg, 0.22 mmol, 100%) as a white solid (MP: 124°C). Column chromatography
was performed with c-hexane/EtOAc 8:2. 16, yield (122 mg, 0.22 mmol,
100%) 1H NMR (250 MHz, CDCl3): δ (ppm) 7.85 (s, 1H), 7.73-7.69 (m, 2H),
7.52-7.48 (m, 2H), 7.42-7.23 (m, 9H), 7.04-7.00 (m, 2H), 5.68 (d, J= 7.2
Hz, 1H), 5.29 (d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 4.28 (s, 2H), 4.15 (d, JAB = 17.0 Hz,
1H), 3.93 (d, JAB = 17.0 Hz, 1H), 2.46-2.23 (m, 2H), 1.42 (s, 9H), 1.11
(t, J= 7.6 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (101 MHz, CDCl3): δ (ppm) 172.8 (C), 170.2
(C), 167.2 (C), 165.7 (C), 140. (C), 138.3 (C), 136.8 (C), 134.7 (C),
129.0 (2 CH), 128.9 (CH), 128.7 (2 CH), 128.6 (2 CH), 128.2 (CH), 128.0
(2 CH), 127.8 (2 CH), 127.7 (CH), 127.5 (2 CH), 112.4 (CH), 82.0 (C),
64.1 (CH2), 62.8 (CH2), 47.5 (C), 42.1 (CH), 28.0 (3 CH3), 27.3 (CH2),
9.0 (CH3); IR (KBr): 3384 (w), 2980 (w), 1748 (s), 1674 (s), 1506 (m),
1368 (m), 1227 (s), 1154 (s), 763 (m), 700 (m); HRMS (EI, 70 eV):
calculated for C34H36N2O6 (M+) 568.2568, found 568.2556.
