$DATUM The Passerini reaction of acid 1 in water gives the product in
quantitative yield after 30 min under ultrasonication.
1-(tert-Butylamino)-4-methyl-1-oxopentan-2-yl 3-methylbut-2-enoate. 1H
NMR δ: 5.82 (br s, 1H), 5.73 (s, 1H), 5.18 (m, 1H), 2.20 (s, 3H), 1.93
(s, 3H), 1.81 (m, 1H), 1.69 (m, 2H), 1.29 (s, 9H), 0.92 (m, 6H). 13C NMR
δ: 170.1, 165.3, 159.4, 115.3, 72.3,51.2, 44.3, 41.3, 28.9, 24.8, 23.7,
22.1, 20.7. LRMS (FAB+) m/z: 270.3 (MH+). This is a known compound.18c
