$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of (4-methoxyphenylcarbamoyl)(furan-2-yl)methyl benzoate (23)
Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 7(67 mg, 0.50
mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (64 mg, 0.53 mmol, 1.05 equiv),
aldehyde 10 (50 mg, 43 μL, 0.53 mmol, 1.05 equiv) and 20 mol % of
catalyst 4 in CH2Cl2was stirred for 24 hrs.After removal of solvent
followed by silica gel chromatography, 23 (172 mg, 95%) was obtained as a
whitish-brown solid. Data for 23: 1H NMR:(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.13-8.10 (m,
2H, aryl); 7.91 (bs, 1H, NH); 7.64-7.60 (m, 2H, aryl); 7.45-7.51 (m, 5H,
aryl); 6.88-6.84 (m, 2H, aryl); 6.65 (d, J = 3.2 Hz, 1H, aryl); 6.58 (s,
1H, CH); 6.41 (dd, J = 1.6, 2.0 Hz, 1H, aryl); 3.79 (s, 3H,CH3) 13C NMR:
(100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 165.0, 164.1, 157.1, 148.0, 144.1, 134.1, 130.4,
130.2, 128.9, 128.7, 122.3, 114.4, 112.0, 111.0, 69.6, 55.7 IR:(neat)
νmax = 1723, 1684, 1512, 1246, 710 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.32 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2)
HRMS: EIMS calculated for C20H17NO5+ [M+ H]+: 352.1186, found: 352.1183
HPLC: (+/−)-23 tR 26.6 min (49.5%); tR 30.5 min (50.5 %) (−)-23 tR 26.7
min (4.6%); tR 30.5 min (95.4%) (Diacel Chiralcel OJ 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm,
5% IPA in Hexane, 1 mL/min; isocratic) OR: [α]D22= -36.8° (CHCl3, c =
7.35)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, molecular sieves used in second stage, molecular sieves
used in third stage, Passerini reaction
