$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of (4-methoxyphenylcarbamoyl)(thiophen-2-yl)methyl benzoate
(28) Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 7 (60 mg,
0.45 mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (58 mg, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv)
and aldehyde 12 (53 mg, 44 μL, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv) in CH2Cl2 was
stirred for 48 hrs. After removal of solvent and silica gel
chromatography, 28 (157 mg, 95%) was obtained as a whitish-green solid.
Data for 28: 1H NMR: (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.15-8.12 (dd, J= 0.8, 8.4 Hz,
2H, aryl); 7.83 (bs, 1H, NH); 7.65-7.61 (tt, J= 1.2, 7.6 Hz, 1H, aryl);
7.52-7.48 (m, 2H, aryl); 7.45-7.42 (m, 2H, aryl); 7.37 (dd, J= 0.8, 5.2
Hz, 1H, aryl); 7.32-7.31 (m, 1H, aryl); 7.02 (dd, J= 3.6, 5.2, 1H, aryl);
6.86-6.84 (m, 2H, aryl); 6.72 (s, 1H, CH); 3.78 (s, 3H, CH3) 13C NMR:
(100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 165.5, 165.1, 157.2, 137.3, 134.1, 130.2, 130.0,
129.1, 129.0, 128.2, 127.4, 127.3, 122.3, 114.4, 72.1, 55.7 IR: (neat)
νmax = 1724, 1671, 1512, 1246, 709 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.29 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2)
HRMS: EIMS calculated for C20H17NO4S+ [M+ H]+: 368.0957, found: 368.0915
HPLC: (+/−)-28 tR 30.9 min (50.4%); tR 36.5 min (49.6 %) (−)-28 tR 31.3
min (5.7%); tR 38.1 min (94.3%) (Diacel Chiralcel OJ 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm,
Gradient; t0 15% IPA in Hexane, t10min 20% IPA in Hexane, t20min 25% IPA
in Hexane, t30min 30% IPA in Hexane, t40min 35% IPA in Hexane, t50min 40%
IPA in Hexane, 1 mL/min) OR: [α]D22 = -6.9° (CHCl3, c = 1.45)
