$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 1-(tert-butylcarbamoyl)-2-(benzyloxy)ethyl benzoate (22)
Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 13 (42 mg, 58 μL,
0.51 mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (65 mg, 0.54 mmol, 1.05 equiv),
al dehyde 6 (80 mg, 86 μL, 0.54 mmol, 1.05 equiv) and 20 mol % of
catalyst 4 in CH2Cl2 was stirred for 24 hrs. After removal of solvent
followed by silica gel chromatography, 22 (181 mg, 95%) was obtained as a
whitish-brown solid. Data for 22: 1H NMR:(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.10-8.07
(dd, J = 1.6, 6.8 Hz, 2H, aryl); 7.64-7.60 (tt, J = 1.2, 7.6 Hz, 2H,
aryl); 7.50-7.46 (t, J = 8.0 Hz, 4H, aryl); 7.30-7.27 (m, 2H, aryl);
6.10(bs, 1H, NH); 5.50 (dd, J = 1.6, 3.2 Hz, 1H, CH2); 4.60 (d, J = 2.4
Hz, 2H,C H2); 4.02-3.98 (dd, J = 4.4, 10.4 Hz, 1H, CH2); 3.93-3.90 (dd, J
= 4.0, 10.8 Hz, 1H, CH2); 1.36 (s, 9H, CH3) 13C NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ
167.1, 165.4, 140.8, 138.0, 134.0, 130.4, 130.1, 128.9, 128.7, 127.8,
73.9, 73.6, 69.7, 51.7, 28.9 IR: (neat) νmax = 1722, 1688, 1290, 1264,
709 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.41 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2) HRMS: EIMS calculated for
C21H25NO4+ [M+ H]+: 356.1863, found: 356.1855 HPLC: (+/−)-22 tR 20.7 min
(50.8%); tR 23.1 min (49.2 %) (+)-22 tR 20.5 min (98.8%); tR 23.3 min
(1.2%) (Diacel Chiralpak AS-H 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm, 2% IPA in Hexane, 0.7
mL/min; isocratic) OR: [α]D22α= + 5.5 ° (CHCl3, c = 2.12)
