$DATUM (2S)-tert-butyl-2-(tert-butoxycarbonylamino)-4-(2-chloroacetoxy)-5-oxo-5-(2,4,6-trimethoxybenzylamino)pentanoate
(14) To a stirred solution of 5 (0.366 g, 1.33 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (10 mL),
isocyanide 6 (0.303 g, 1.46 mmol) and chloroacetic acid 7 (0.138 g, 1.46
mmol) was added. The reaction was stirred at room temperature for 24 h.
The solvent was removed under vacuum and the residue was chromatographed
on silica gel (EtOAc/Hexanes, 30/70 to 40/60, V/V) to give 14 as a waxy
white solid (0.727 g, 95%).
(2S)-tert-butyl-2-(tert-butoxycarbonylamino)-4-(2-chloroacetoxy)-5-oxo-5-(2,4,6-trimethoxybenzylamino)pentanoate
(14), yield (0.727 g, 95%). 1H NMR (200 MHz, CDCl3) δ 6.79 (br s, 0.5 H),
6.48 (t, 0.5 H, J = 5.1 Hz), 5.26-5.03 (m, 2 H), 4.65-4.22 (m, 3 H), 4.13
(d, 2 H, J = 13.4 Hz), 3.81 (s, 9 H), 2.51-2.05 (m, 2 H), 1.46 (s, 9 H),
1.42 (d, 9 H, J = 5.8 Hz). 13C NMR (50 MHz, CDCl3) δ 171.1, 171.0, 168.0,
167.6, 166.4, 166.2, 161.2, 159.4, 155.5, 106.3, 106.1, 90.8, 82.6, 82.5,
80.2, 72.5, 71.9, 55.9, 55.5, 51.1, 50.5, 40.9, 40.7, 34.9, 34.7, 32.5,
28.4, 28.1. HRMS calcd for C26H40ClN2O10 (M + H)+: 575.2371, found:
575.2360.
