100 MHz): δ = 28.26 (C(CH3)3), 30.27 (CHCH2C), 50.04 (PhCH2N), 51.43
(C(CH3)3), 59.69 (CHCH2C); 118.80 (C=CHCO), 126.07 (ar-CH), 128.65
