$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Ugi product 12c. According to General Procedure I, reaction between
alkylated DHP-2-one 11 (100 mg, 0.22 mmol), paraformaldehyde (10 mg, 0.33
mmol), benzylamine (36 μl, 0.33 mmol) and Z-Gly-OH (50 mg, 0.24 mmol) in
MeOH (1.5 ml) afforded after 22 h. 12c (155 mg, 0.12 mmol, 91%) as a
white foam. Column chromatography was performed with c-hexane/EtOAc 7:3→
6:4 12c, yield (155 mg, 0.12 mmol, 91%) 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO, 403K): δ
(ppm) 7.87 (s, 1H), 7.68-7.65 (m, 2H), 7.43-7.41 (m, 2H), 7.36-7.22 (m,
17H), 7.07-7.05 (m, 2H), 7.01-6.98 (m, 2H), 6.57 (bs, 1H), 5.68 (d, J=
7.2 Hz, 1H), 5.20 (d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 5.07 (s, 2H), 4.24 (d, JAB = 15.8
Hz, 1H), 4.19 (d, JAB = 15.8 Hz, 1H), 4.04 (d, JAB = 17.0 Hz, 1H), 3.90
(d, JAB = 17.0 Hz, 1H), 3.82-3.60 (m, 4H), 1.36 (s, 9H); 13C NMR (101
MHz, DMSO, 403K): δ (ppm) 168.8 (2 C), 166.1 (C), 165.5 (C), 155.4 (C),
138.9 (C), 138.7 (C), 137.1 (C), 136.6 (C), 136.0 (C), 133.9 (C), 128.2
(2 CH), 127.9 (CH), 127.7 (2 CH), 127.6 (4 CH), 127.5 (CH), 126.9 (2 CH),
126.8 (4 CH), 126.7 (4 CH), 126.5 (4 CH), 126.4 (CH), 111.7 (CH), 80.9
(C), 65.0 (CH2), 63.3 (C), 49.3 (CH2), 48.5 (CH2), 46.6 (CH2), 42.0 (CH),
41.5 (CH2), 27.0 (3 CH3). IR (neat): 3341 (w), 2976 (w), 1742 (m), 1711
(m), 1668 (s), 1640 (m), 1495 (s), 1368 (m), 1209 (s), 1152 (s), 756 (m),
735 (s), 696 (s), 590 (m), 548 (m). HRMS (FAB): calculated for C48H49N4O7
(MH+) 793.3596, found 793.3597.
